scripts/checks/lib/stack_bound.py:5:       stack_bound.py ARCH DISASM --ranges    -> also prints `range SYM LO HI` per Concrete function
scripts/checks/lib/stack_bound.py:16:`_exit`, `abort`) is entered; the external functions' own use is outside it (a premise, listed),
scripts/checks/lib/stack_bound.py:37:# External functions that do not return (part of the libc premise): a path ends at a call to one.
scripts/checks/lib/stack_bound.py:518:        sys.exit("usage: stack_bound.py x86_64|aarch64 DISASM [--ranges]")
